{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Warn the people.</b> Warn them not to ascend the mountain." "<b>Lest they break through, etc.</b> That they not break their formation, because their craving toward YHWH to see would make them approach the side of the mountain." "<b>And many fall from it.</b> Whatever falls from them — even a single one — is counted before Me as many (ibid.)." "<b>Lest they break through.</b> Every הֲרִיסָה disperses the assembled structure; likewise, those who separate from a group's formation are מַהֲרִיסִים the formation."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:11.759811773Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}